SOURCELONG:Celmae Campaign Setting	SOURCESHORT:CEL	SOURCEDATE:2026-03

# Lets Invocateur Qualifié raise the Monster Tactician's summon monster ability: its tiers now
# follow CelmaeSummonLVL, which the feat raises, instead of the bare inquisitor level.
CATEGORY=Special Ability|Monster Tactician ~ Summon Monster.MOD	SPELLS:.CLEARALL	DEFINE:CelmaeSummonClassLVL|0	DEFINE:CelmaeSummonLVL|0	BONUS:VAR|CelmaeSummonClassLVL|InquisitorLVL	BONUS:VAR|CelmaeSummonLVL|InquisitorLVL	SPELLS:Innate|TIMES=3+WIS|CASTERLEVEL=CelmaeSummonLVL|Summon Monster I (Monster Tactician)|!PREVARGTEQ:CelmaeSummonLVL,3	SPELLS:Innate|TIMES=3+WIS|CASTERLEVEL=CelmaeSummonLVL|Summon Monster II (Monster Tactician)|PREVARGTEQ:CelmaeSummonLVL,3|!PREVARGTEQ:CelmaeSummonLVL,5	SPELLS:Innate|TIMES=3+WIS|CASTERLEVEL=CelmaeSummonLVL|Summon Monster III (Monster Tactician)|PREVARGTEQ:CelmaeSummonLVL,5|!PREVARGTEQ:CelmaeSummonLVL,7	SPELLS:Innate|TIMES=3+WIS|CASTERLEVEL=CelmaeSummonLVL|Summon Monster IV (Monster Tactician)|PREVARGTEQ:CelmaeSummonLVL,7|!PREVARGTEQ:CelmaeSummonLVL,9	SPELLS:Innate|TIMES=3+WIS|CASTERLEVEL=CelmaeSummonLVL|Summon Monster V (Monster Tactician)|PREVARGTEQ:CelmaeSummonLVL,9|!PREVARGTEQ:CelmaeSummonLVL,11	SPELLS:Innate|TIMES=3+WIS|CASTERLEVEL=CelmaeSummonLVL|Summon Monster VI (Monster Tactician)|PREVARGTEQ:CelmaeSummonLVL,11|!PREVARGTEQ:CelmaeSummonLVL,13	SPELLS:Innate|TIMES=3+WIS|CASTERLEVEL=CelmaeSummonLVL|Summon Monster VII (Monster Tactician)|PREVARGTEQ:CelmaeSummonLVL,13|!PREVARGTEQ:CelmaeSummonLVL,15	SPELLS:Innate|TIMES=3+WIS|CASTERLEVEL=CelmaeSummonLVL|Summon Monster VIII (Monster Tactician)|PREVARGTEQ:CelmaeSummonLVL,15|!PREVARGTEQ:CelmaeSummonLVL,17	SPELLS:Innate|TIMES=3+WIS|CASTERLEVEL=CelmaeSummonLVL|Summon Monster IX (Monster Tactician)|PREVARGTEQ:CelmaeSummonLVL,17
CATEGORY=FEAT|Invocateur Qualifié.MOD	BONUS:CASTERLEVEL|Inquisitor|4|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Monster Tactician ~ Summon Monster
